{
  "movie_id": 508200001,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 5.7,
      "end_time": 8.8,
      "text": "Oh, to think I'd meet you right here"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 9.2,
      "end_time": 11.2,
      "text": "Haaa ha ha ha!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 11.4,
      "end_time": 15.1,
      "text": "Happy New Year, I suppose that's how it goes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 15.8,
      "end_time": 18.4,
      "text": "I think that's quite the hasty greeting in this situation..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 19.7,
      "end_time": 23.2,
      "text": "At a time like this, \"I thank you for your aid in this past year\"."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 23.4,
      "end_time": 25.0,
      "text": "That fits better"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 26.0,
      "end_time": 28.5,
      "text": "How about it? Does this suit me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 28.8,
      "end_time": 33.8,
      "text": "Now that I’ve conquered Christmas, New Year's will easily be next"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 34.0,
      "end_time": 37.2,
      "text": "To start, I heard Ruka knew a lot about traditional New Year's garments..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 37.9,
      "end_time": 40.0,
      "text": "I merely introduced her to a familiar place"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 40.2,
      "end_time": 42.7,
      "text": "And while I was at it, I got my own look to sport"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 44.0,
      "end_time": 45.4,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 48.0,
      "end_time": 49.8,
      "text": "...What is it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 50.0,
      "end_time": 52.8,
      "text": "It's embarrassing when you stare at me like that"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 53.0,
      "end_time": 57.0,
      "text": "So what are you doing in a place like this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 57.7,
      "end_time": 59.0,
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 60.8,
      "end_time": 62.0,
      "text": "Ta-dah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 63.0,
      "end_time": 63.8,
      "text": "Oh, my"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 64.0,
      "end_time": 66.0,
      "text": "So you joined up with Illya and Ruka"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 66.9,
      "end_time": 68.0,
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 68.9,
      "end_time": 70.1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 70.8,
      "end_time": 72.2,
      "text": "Come on, Lady Sheffy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 81.0,
      "end_time": 83.0,
      "text": "Wh-What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 84.0,
      "end_time": 84.8,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 85.0,
      "end_time": 88.0,
      "text": "Lady Sheffy, please try turning around"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 89.8,
      "end_time": 91.0,
      "text": "Like this, I guess?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 92.0,
      "end_time": 93.8,
      "text": "That's wonderful, Sheffy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 94.2,
      "end_time": 95.6,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 97.4,
      "end_time": 101.2,
      "text": "I see. So you were waiting for Sheffy's furisode debut"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 102.8,
      "end_time": 104.0,
      "text": "Hehe, and it seems she left quite an impression on him"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 104.8,
      "end_time": 106.7,
      "text": "I also went through the trouble to get us dressed aswell"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 107.0,
      "end_time": 108.0,
      "text": "What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 108.2,
      "end_time": 109.0,
      "text": "Hohoh"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 109.3,
      "end_time": 112.0,
      "text": "You all look the part..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 112.2,
      "end_time": 113.6,
      "text": "Almost like a perfect picture"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 113.8,
      "end_time": 114.5,
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 114.7,
      "end_time": 116.4,
      "text": "Thank you, everyone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 116.8,
      "end_time": 117.8,
      "text": "Eheheh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 118.0,
      "end_time": 120.2,
      "text": "Now we're all ready to go☆"
    }
  ],
